  description: '"Grapha, Dragon Lord of Dark World" + 1 DARK monster

    When your
    opponent activates a monster effect, or a Normal Spell/Trap Card, while you have
    a card(s) in your hand (Quick Effect): You can activate this effect; the activated
    effect becomes "Your opponent discards 1 card". You can only use this effect
    of "Grapha, Dragon Overlord of Dark World" once per turn. If this Fusion Summoned
    card in its owner''s control leaves the field because of an opponent''s card:
    You can Special Summon 1 of your "Grapha, Dragon Lord of Dark World" that is
    banished or in your GY, then each player with a hand discards 1 card.'
